xt Starlette, while keeping backwards compatibility\n\n\u267b\ufe0f Re-implement `on_event` in FastAPI for compatibility with the next Starlette, while keeping backwards compatibility\r\n\r\nOnce there's a better interface for `lifespan` or a comparable alternative, `on_event` and others will be deprecated and later removed. But while that new interface is available, I'm re-implementing it on the FastAPI side."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "I'll localize with the graph tools first, starting from the symbols named in the issue.\n<|tool_call|>{\"name\": \"search_similar_code\", \"arguments\": {\"symbol\": \"app\"}}<|tool_call_end|>"}, {"role": "user", "content": "{\n \"symbol\": \"app\",\n \"matches\": [\n  {\n   \"file\": \"fastapi/routing.py\",\n   \"line\": 91,\n   \"kind\": \"definition\"\n  }\n ]\n}"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "app is defined in fastapi/routing.py. Checking its callers and callees before reading any file.\n<|tool_call|>{\"name\": \"get_code_neighbors\", \"arguments\": {\"symbol\": \"app\"}}<|tool_call_end|>"}, {"role": "user", "content": "{\n \"symbol\": \"app\",\n \"callers\": [\n  \"_AsyncLiftContextManager\",\n  \"__init__\",\n  \"__aenter__\"\n ],\n \"callees\": [\n  \"_AsyncLiftContextManager\",\n  \"__init__\",\n  \"__aenter__\"\n ],\n \"note\": \"neighbors derived from symbols co-occurring in the patch\"\n}"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Getting the surrounding call graph so I read only the files that matter.\n<|tool_call|>{\"name\": \"get_code_subgraph\", \"arguments\": {\"symbol\": \"app\"}}<|tool_call_end|>"}], "metadata": {"source": "programmatic", "instance_id": "fastapi_14851", "repo": "fastapi/fastapi", "base_commit": "8e50c55fd90c4433ddc9096ff439da9498a8314a", "files": ["fastapi/routing.py"], "symbols": ["app", "_AsyncLiftContextManager", "__init__", "__aenter__"], "n_hunks": 5, "n_files": 1, "stripped_hunks": 0, "lossy_hunks": 0, "test_target": ["tests/test_router_events.py"], "test_target_source": "test_patch", "synthesized": {"graph_observations": true, "repro_observations": true, "test_observations": true, "read_observations": "snapshot", "reasoning_text": true, "repro_script": "generic"}, "note": "Programmatic replay of the reference patch; graph/repro/test observations are synthesized from patch context, not live tool outputs. Read-file observations are snapshot.", "turns": 15, "generator": "gen_programmatic.py v1", "traj_turn": 2, "tool": "get_code_subgraph", "est_tokens": 1282, "split_from": "fastapi_14851"}}
