## Summary\r\n\r\nRelated to #10787\r\n\r\nThe OpenAPI `ValidationError` schema was outdated and didn't reflect the actual error format returned by Pydantic V2.\r\n\r\n## Changes\r\nUpdated `validation_error_definition` in `fastapi/openapi/utils.py` to include:\r\n- `input`: The actual input value that caused the validation error  \r\n- `ctx`: Optional context dictionary with additional error information\r\n\r\n## Testing\r\nAll existing tests pass with the updated schema. The test snapshots have been updated to reflect the new schema structure."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "I'll localize with the graph tools first, starting from the symbols named in the issue.\n<|tool_call|>{\"name\": \"search_similar_code\", \"arguments\": {\"symbol\": \"utils\"}}<|tool_call_end|>"}, {"role": "user", "content": "{\n \"symbol\": \"utils\",\n \"matches\": [\n  {\n   \"file\": \"fastapi/openapi/utils.py\",\n   \"line\": 49,\n   \"kind\": \"definition\"\n  }\n ]\n}"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "utils is defined in fastapi/openapi/utils.py. Checking its callers and callees before reading any file.\n<|tool_call|>{\"name\": \"get_code_neighbors\", \"arguments\": {\"symbol\": \"utils\"}}<|tool_call_end|>"}], "metadata": {"source": "programmatic", "instance_id": "fastapi_14791", "repo": "fastapi/fastapi", "base_commit": "08924400c2c75533685148b029defcf6913f1def", "files": ["fastapi/openapi/utils.py"], "symbols": [], "n_hunks": 1, "n_files": 1, "stripped_hunks": 0, "lossy_hunks": 0, "test_target": ["tests/test_additional_properties.py", "tests/test_additional_properties_bool.py"], "test_target_source": "test_patch", "synthesized": {"graph_observations": true, "repro_observations": true, "test_observations": true, "read_observations": "snapshot", "reasoning_text": true, "repro_script": "generic"}, "note": "Programmatic replay of the reference patch; graph/repro/test observations are synthesized from patch context, not live tool outputs. Read-file observations are snapshot.", "t