ction has been updated to handle `Series` inputs by converting them to `DataFrame` objects before using the `assign` method. Now, let's create a script to reproduce the error using the provided example and execute it to confirm that the error is resolved.\n<|tool_call|>{\"name\": \"write_file\", \"arguments\": {\"path\": \"/workspace/pandas-dev__pandas__2.1/reproduce_error.py\", \"content\": \"\\nimport pandas as pd\\n\\nls = pd.Series([1, 2, 3, 4], index=[1, 2, 3, 4], name=\\\"left\\\")\\nrs = pd.Series([3, 4, 5, 6], index=[3, 4, 5, 6], name=\\\"right\\\")\\n\\ntry:\\n    result = pd.merge(ls, rs, how=\\\"cross\\\")\\n    print(\\\"Merge successful. Result:\\\")\\n    print(result)\\nexcept Exception as e:\\n    print(\\\"Error during merge:\\\", e)\\n\"}}<|tool_call_end|>"}, {"role": "user", "content": "EXECUTION RESULT of [str_replace_editor]:\nFile created successfully at: /workspace/pandas-dev__pandas__2.1/reproduce_error.py"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "<|tool_call|>{\"name\": \"run_command\", \"arguments\": {\"command\": \"python /workspace/pandas-dev__pandas__2.1/reproduce_error.py\"}}<|tool_call_end|>"}, {"role": "user", "content": "EXECUTION RESULT of [execute_bash]:\n[Runtime (ID=zidzivgjomqlipdx)] Action execution failed: 504 Server Error: Gateway Timeout for url: https://zidzivgjomqlipdx.eval-runtime.all-hands.dev/execute_action\n[Error occurred in processing last action]"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "<|tool_call|>{\"name\": \"run_command\", \"arguments\": {\"command\": \"python3 /workspace/pandas-dev__pandas__2.1/reproduce_error.py\"}}<|tool_call_end|>"}, {"role": "user", "content": "EXECUTION RESULT of [execute_bash]:\npython3 /workspace/pandas-dev__pandas__2.1/reproduce_error.py\r\npython3: can't open file '/workspace/pandas-dev__pandas__2.1/reproduce_error.py': [Errno 2] No such file or directory[Python Interpreter: /opt/miniconda3/envs/testbed/bin/python]\nroot@openhands-workspace:/workspace # \n[Command finished with exit code 2]"}, 