r\n- Added \"too_early\" to type definition of status code 425\r\n- Added tests for retrieving 425 when querying type definitions\r\n- In accordance with RFC 4918 and 8470.\r\n"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Before editing anything, I'll write a small repro script under /tmp that triggers the reported failure.\n<|tool_call|>{\"name\": \"write_file\", \"arguments\": {\"path\": \"/tmp/repro_requests_6592.py\", \"content\": \"\\\"\\\"\\\"Repro for requests_6592 (programmatic replay; generic script).\\\"\\\"\\\"\\nimport sys\\nsys.path.insert(0, \\\"/workspace\\\")\\n\\nfrom requests.status_codes import status_codes  # noqa: F401\\n\\n# Reported failure (from the issue):\\n# \\\"TOO_EARLY\\\" type definition for status code 425 Addressing issue #6584: - Added \\\"too_early\\\" to type definition of status code 425 - Added tests for retrieving 425 when querying type definitions - In a...\\n# A faithful repro needs the exact failing call from the issue, so\\n# this script confirms the module imports and the symbol exists;\\n# the failure itself is triggered from the issue's example.\\nprint(\\\"repro ready:\\\", status_codes)\\n\"}}<|tool_call_end|>"}, {"role": "user", "content": "File written."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Running the repro to confirm the reported failure.\n<|tool_call|>{\"name\": \"run_command\", \"arguments\": {\"command\": \"python /tmp/repro_requests_6592.py\"}}<|tool_call_end|>"}, {"role": "user", "content": "FAIL: \"TOO_EARLY\" type definition for status code 425 Addressing issue #6584: - Added \"too_early\" to type definition of status code 425 - Added tests for retrieving 425 when querying type definitions - In a..."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Applying the fix in src/requests/status_codes.py (hunk at line 79).\n<|tool_call|>{\"name\": \"edit_file\", \"arguments\": {\"path\": \"src/requests/status_codes.py\", \"old_text\": \"    422: (\\\"unprocessable_entity\\\", \\\"unprocessable\\\"),\\n    423: (\\\"locked\\\",),\\n    42