@ofek @webknjaz @hugovk \r\n\r\nRelevant discussion: https://github.com/Textualize/rich/issues/2924\r\n"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "I'll localize with the graph tools first, starting from the symbols named in the issue.\n<|tool_call|>{\"name\": \"search_similar_code\", \"arguments\": {\"symbol\": \"group\"}}<|tool_call_end|>"}, {"role": "user", "content": "{\n \"symbol\": \"group\",\n \"matches\": [\n  {\n   \"file\": \"rich/console.py\",\n   \"line\": 495,\n   \"kind\": \"definition\"\n  }\n ]\n}"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "group is defined in rich/console.py. Checking its callers and callees before reading any file.\n<|tool_call|>{\"name\": \"get_code_neighbors\", \"arguments\": {\"symbol\": \"group\"}}<|tool_call_end|>"}, {"role": "user", "content": "{\n \"symbol\": \"group\",\n \"callers\": [\n  \"decorator\",\n  \"__init__\",\n  \"is_terminal\"\n ],\n \"callees\": [\n  \"decorator\",\n  \"__init__\",\n  \"is_terminal\"\n ],\n \"note\": \"neighbors derived from symbols co-occurring in the patch\"\n}"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Getting the surrounding call graph so I read only the files that matter.\n<|tool_call|>{\"name\": \"get_code_subgraph\", \"arguments\": {\"symbol\": \"group\"}}<|tool_call_end|>"}], "metadata": {"source": "programmatic", "instance_id": "rich_3675", "repo": "Textualize/rich", "base_commit": "edc6b0a39b6df1c0e26d409bb5c5eda7149b2de6", "files": ["rich/console.py", "rich/diagnose.py"], "symbols": ["group", "decorator", "__init__", "is_terminal"], "n_hunks": 5, "n_files": 2, "stripped_hunks": 0, "lossy_hunks": 0, "test_target": ["tests/test_console.py"], "test_target_source": "test_patch", "synthesized": {"graph_observations": true, "repro_observations": true, "test_observations": true, "read_observations": "snapshot", "reasoning_text": true, "repro_script": "generic"}, "note": "Programmatic replay of the reference patch; graph/repro/test observations are synthesized from patch context, not live tool outputs. Read-fil